---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Pole Rentals"
  description="Pole rental information for Arizona Pole Vault Academy athletes via PVR."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Equipment</p>
      <h1>Pole Rentals</h1>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <p>
        AZPVA maintains a large on-site pole fleet for training. For formal rentals and PVR app coordination, contact staff —
        Garrett is a primary contact for pole logistics.
      </p>
      <ul class="list-check">
        <li>Academy phone: <a href="tel:+14807666017">(480) 766-6017</a></li>
        <li>Pole / PVR questions: Garrett — <a href="tel:+18058352811">(805) 835-2811</a></li>
      </ul>
      <p>Membership benefits around borrowing poles can differ by Elite vs Lite — confirm details when you enroll.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
